  concept: 'Authored objective: Repair three independent hardware faults.

    Authored
    requirement: Repair wheel 3 overcurrent, tracker B via and tach reference. Requalify
    after each.

    General teaching principle: Troubleshooting compares fresh evidence
    with a known reference, isolates likely causes, repairs the supported issue and
    retests.

    Only fresh, authoritative game evidence can establish that this
    objective is complete.'
  analogy: Debugging a chain is easier when each link is tested before replacing
    the next.
